Since all of the rules mention the bear chasing the mouse, and there\'s plenty of information about the mouse\'s behavior towards the bear, I can conclude that it\'s true and not false.</think>\nTherefore, the option is ']]  4%|3         | 23/600 [01:11<29:36,  3.08s/it]
