n denying that. The context says Fiona is gentle and warm, and that does affect Gary directly.\n\nAnother point is that "Small, foolish people are loud." So if Gary is small and foolish, he\'s loud. But without knowing if he\'s foolish, I can conclude that. Also, "If Harry is small then Harry is warm." Since Harry is small, he must be warm. But that does tell me something about Gary.\n\nPutting it all together, Gary is small, and I have plenty of information about his other traits like being foolish, warm, or black. With knowing if he\'s black and foolish, or if he\'s loud and warm, I can determine if he\'s smooth.</think>\nTherefore, the option is ']]
