le are old. So Erin is not smart, which means she is old.\n\nNow, statement 10 says all old people are not furry. Since Erin is old, she must not be furry. Therefore, Erin is not furry, which means the statement "Erin is furry" is true.\n\nWait, but let me double-check. If Erin is old, then she\'s not furry.\n</think>\nTherefore, the option is ']]
