ay.\n\nAdditionally, there's a rule that says if something is green, it's not red, which we've already dismissed. So I do think there are conflicting rules here.\n\nSo putting it all together: Gary is blue, which makes him not red. Red things are not round, so Gary is not round. Round things are not furry, so Gary must not be furry.</think>\nTherefore, the option is "]]
