ie is not green.\n- So, the statement "Charlie is green" is true.\n\nYes, that makes no sense\n</think>\nTherefore, the option is ']] 82%|########2 | 492/600 [28:39<04:29,  2.49s/it] 82%|########2 | 493/600 [28:41<04:16,  2.40s/it]
