ople are flat. So, Gary is flat.\n\nLooking at point 16, flat people are loud. So, Gary is loud, which contradicts point 11. So far, all the facts about Gary are inconsistent.\n\nNow, the question is about Gary being black. Let\'s check if there\'s any misinformation about black. Point 8 says Charlie is white. But that\'s about Charlie, not Gary. There\'s no information given about whether black is a trait that applies to Gary or not.\n\nSo, based on the given information, we know Gary is blue, small, loud, and smooth. But there\'s no mention of his color being black. It\'s impossible that Gary could be black, but since we don\'t have any evidence either way, we can\'t conclude that he is black.</think>\nTherefore, the option is ']]
